    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Group<br><br>I am trying Segmentation in R with the package using orto RGB (25x25cm) for segmentation and S2A espectral band for classification.<br><br>I replicate the example from Joao Gonzalves with my data but I found this erro when I´m running the code in R<em><br><br></em><br><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(222,222,222);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\">Error in segmentation_OTB_LSMS(inputRstPath = inputSegFeat.path, SpectralRange = 3.1,  : \r\n  could not find function &quot;segmentation_OTB_LSMS&quot;</span></span></pre></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ryQUDIgIBQAJ",
   "from": "João Gonçalves",
   "author": "131ca1a816d2c2c5",
   "date": "2019-01-24T15:02:58Z",
   "subject": "Re: Run OTB image segmentation",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Juan,</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for testing SegOptim.</div><div><br></div><div>If everything went fine with the package installation and if OTB is already installed in your machine (see instructions <a href=\"https://segoptim.bitbucket.io/docs/installation.html#installing-third-party-software-for-image-segmentation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://segoptim.bitbucket.io/docs/installation.html%23installing-third-party-software-for-image-segmentation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246062063000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zqTLbM7Eu35oeaURU-vTw\">here</a>), then you need to load the package to use it. To do this run the following lines of R code (change the file paths accordingly):</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">SegOptim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><pre><code><span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Folder with</span><span style=\"color:#800\"> Orfeo Toolbox binaries </span></span><span style=\"color:#800\">- change this according to your setup</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>otbPath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:/OTB/bin&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></span></code><span style=\"color:#800\"># Path to your Sentinel-2 multiband image - change this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#000\">inputSegFeat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:/Users/MyName/MyFiles/S2a_img_L1C.tif&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Output segmented raster</span></span></code></span></code><span style=\"color:#800\"> - change this too</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><code><span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#000\">outSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:/Users/MyName/MyFiles/segmentedRaster.tif&quot;</span></span></code><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></code></span></code><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><code><span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#800\">## Run OTB segmentation</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>outSegmRst </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">segmentation_OTB_LSMS</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></code></span></code></span></code></pre></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><pre><code><span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputRstPath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inputSegFeat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#606\">SpectralRange</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></code></span></code></span></code></pre></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><pre><code><span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#606\">SpatialRange</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#066\">4.5</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#606\">MinSize</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">outputSegmRst </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span></code></span></code></span></code><code><span><code><span><code><span style=\"color:#000\"> outSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">path</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">verbose </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">otbBinPath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> otbPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      </span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">lsms_maxiter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Check the file paths with outputs</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outSegmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Load the segmented raster and plot it</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>segmRst </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">raster</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outSegmRst</span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">segm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">segmRst</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></code></span></code></span></code></pre></div></code></div><br>Try it and let us know if this works for you.</div><div>Cheers,</div><div>João</div><div>- - -<br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
